[
  {
    "id": 46,
    "text": "In the quiet spaces of your mind, you will find the strength to rewrite the stories that anger once dictated.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Anger Management",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.590317",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.590317",
    "uid": "quote-000046"
  },
  {
    "id": 49,
    "text": "To master anger, one must first learn to sit with its shadow in stillness, understanding its whispers before acting on its roar.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Anger Management",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.603830",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.603830",
    "uid": "quote-000049"
  },
  {
    "id": 53,
    "text": "Anger demands an audience; silence denies it. In this quiet refusal lies the power to transform conflict into clarity.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Anger Management",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.623657",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.623657",
    "uid": "quote-000053"
  },
  {
    "id": 57,
    "text": "Let silence be your sanctuary, a place where anger dissolves and understanding rises like dawn breaking over darkness.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Anger Management",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.645378",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.645378",
    "uid": "quote-000057"
  },
  {
    "id": 61,
    "text": "Do not let anger define you; allow the quiet after the storm to shape who you choose to become.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Anger Management",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 1,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.663469",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.663469",
    "uid": "quote-000061"
  },
  {
    "id": 65,
    "text": "Anger may knock at your door, but silence decides whether to invite it in or send it away.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Anger Management",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.682703",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.682703",
    "uid": "quote-000065"
  },
  {
    "id": 69,
    "text": "The fire of anger burns brightest when fed by reckless words; starve it with silence, and watch it dim.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Anger Management",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.703738",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.703738",
    "uid": "quote-000069"
  },
  {
    "id": 73,
    "text": "Anger fades like mist under sunlight when met with the steady warmth of silent understanding.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Anger Management",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 1,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.727987",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.727987",
    "uid": "quote-000073"
  },
  {
    "id": 78,
    "text": "Anger is a wildfire; self-control is the river that carves its path.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Anger Management",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.759216",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.759216",
    "uid": "quote-000078"
  },
  {
    "id": 81,
    "text": "Rage is a guest; let silence be the host that bids it farewell.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Anger Management",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.779232",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.779232",
    "uid": "quote-000081"
  },
  {
    "id": 84,
    "text": "Anger shouts for attention; self-control whispers for peace.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Anger Management",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.799823",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.799823",
    "uid": "quote-000084"
  },
  {
    "id": 87,
    "text": "Let your anger be a shadow—brief, silent, and gone with the light.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Anger Management",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.816090",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.816090",
    "uid": "quote-000087"
  },
  {
    "id": 90,
    "text": "The furnace of anger cools only in the stillness you command.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Anger Management",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.836524",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.836524",
    "uid": "quote-000090"
  },
  {
    "id": 93,
    "text": "Anger is a wind that scatters; silence gathers what matters.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Anger Management",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 1,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.862528",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.862528",
    "uid": "quote-000093"
  },
  {
    "id": 96,
    "text": "Hold your temper as you would a fragile thread—gently, with intent.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Anger Management",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.885614",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.885614",
    "uid": "quote-000096"
  },
  {
    "id": 98,
    "text": "Anger is a spark; silence is the shield that keeps it from burning.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Anger Management",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.897349",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.897349",
    "uid": "quote-000098"
  },
  {
    "id": 102,
    "text": "Anger demands a stage; self-control dismantles the theater.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Anger Management",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.922900",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.922900",
    "uid": "quote-000102"
  },
  {
    "id": 106,
    "text": "Let silence be the sieve that filters rage from reason.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Anger Management",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.945774",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.945774",
    "uid": "quote-000106"
  },
  {
    "id": 108,
    "text": "The fiercest battles are won not with fists, but with restraint.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Anger Management",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.959992",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.959992",
    "uid": "quote-000108"
  },
  {
    "id": 111,
    "text": "He who can hold his fire burns no bridges.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Anger Management",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.980354",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:47.980354",
    "uid": "quote-000111"
  },
  {
    "id": 115,
    "text": "Anger is a spark; discipline is the fireproof soul.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Anger Management",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.012942",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.012942",
    "uid": "quote-000115"
  },
  {
    "id": 121,
    "text": "Don’t let one moment of rage undo years of patience.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Anger Management",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.054830",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.054830",
    "uid": "quote-000121"
  },
  {
    "id": 125,
    "text": "Silence in anger is the loudest act of strength.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Anger Management",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.081586",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.081586",
    "uid": "quote-000125"
  },
  {
    "id": 130,
    "text": "Be the calm that tames the wildfire, not the spark that starts it.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Anger Management",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.134437",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.134437",
    "uid": "quote-000130"
  },
  {
    "id": 134,
    "text": "When you win over your temper, you win over yourself.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Anger Management",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.175033",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.175033",
    "uid": "quote-000134"
  },
  {
    "id": 140,
    "text": "Speak not from anger, but from clarity—or not at all.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Anger Management",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.231355",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.231355",
    "uid": "quote-000140"
  },
  {
    "id": 141,
    "text": "In mastering your temper, you teach the world how to treat you.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Anger Management",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.241139",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.241139",
    "uid": "quote-000141"
  },
  {
    "id": 146,
    "text": "Rage is temporary, but its ruins can last forever.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Anger Management",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.282298",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.282298",
    "uid": "quote-000146"
  },
  {
    "id": 148,
    "text": "Anger is a storm that passes, but the damage it leaves can last forever. Master the calm.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Anger Management",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.303636",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.303636",
    "uid": "quote-000148"
  },
  {
    "id": 152,
    "text": "The fire of anger burns the one who holds it. Let it go before it consumes you.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Anger Management",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.343387",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.343387",
    "uid": "quote-000152"
  },
  {
    "id": 156,
    "text": "Anger is a temporary madness; self-control is the cure.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Anger Management",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.380807",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.380807",
    "uid": "quote-000156"
  },
  {
    "id": 160,
    "text": "When anger rises, pause—what you do next defines your character.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Anger Management",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.422559",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.422559",
    "uid": "quote-000160"
  },
  {
    "id": 164,
    "text": "Anger is a weak man’s imitation of strength.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Anger Management",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.459841",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.459841",
    "uid": "quote-000164"
  },
  {
    "id": 168,
    "text": "A moment of patience in anger can save a lifetime of regret.",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Anger Management",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.501303",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.501303",
    "uid": "quote-000168"
  },
  {
    "id": 172,
    "text": "غصہ ایک زہر ہے جو پینے والے کو ہی مارتا ہے۔",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Anger Management",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.541989",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.541989",
    "uid": "quote-000172"
  },
  {
    "id": 176,
    "text": "غصے میں فیصلے کرنا، اندھیرے میں چلنے کے برابر ہے۔",
    "author": "",
    "category": "Anger Management",
    "source": "manual",
    "is_favorite": 0,
    "is_used": 0,
    "usage_count": 0,
    "background_style": "sunrise",
    "text_align": "center",
    "font_size": 30.0,
    "show_author": 1,
    "created_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.583488",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-18T01:35:48.583488",
    "uid": "quote-000176"
  }
]
